WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.130
Medium drill kick connects before the light sequence.

2
00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:01.880
Standing and crouching light punches lead into cancel Drive Rush.

3
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:02.480
The Drive Rush crouching light punch connects.

4
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:02.930
Back medium punch sets up Blast.

5
00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:03.480
Medium Yoga Blast launches the opponent.

6
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:03.580
The opponent falls as Dhalsim begins to reposition.
